_count_mass_product_form_and_identity_fields","separate_jurisdiction_specific_chocolate_label_and_fat_rules_from_exact_sku_classification","specify_the_dated_same_sku_before_after_evidence_needed_for_recipe_change_and_shrinkflation_claims","reconcile_quality_decline_rating_disagreement_and_temperature_anecdotes_without_cross_category_transfer","verify_current_physical_packages_ingredients_allergens_net_quantity_identity_market_lot_delivered_cost_and_any_historical_counterparts","calculate_comparable_unit_and_accepted_serving_costs_only_after_pack_and_product_form_normalization","run_a_small_matched_office_trial_with_brand_masking_and_predeclared_local_outcomes","choose_the_lowest_total_cost_exact_offer_passing_all_current_label_safety_budget_and_local_trial_gates_or_use_an_accepted_control_or_defer"],"constraints":["keep_each_title_sku_price_rating_review_count_pack_count_mass_flavor_and_manufacturer_or_repacker_statement_at_frozen_seller_assertion_scope","carry_every_displayed_rating_with_its_review_count_and_do_not_treat_100_percent_over_one_or_two_reviews_as_equal_to_a_larger_sample","do_not_treat_the_goldenberg_same_quality_and_taste_always_known_copy_as_a_historical_recipe_or_taste_comparison","preserve_the_godiva_pages_ambiguous_mass_carton_and_mini_bar_wording_and_its_candy_cabin_identity_field","do_not_infer_current_ingredients_cocoa_butter_substitution_formula_version_or_applicable_legal_category_from_brand_or_title_alone","state_chocolate_naming_and_fat_rules_by_market_and_jurisdiction_and_do_not_present_the_frozen_background_as_current_legal_advice","require_dated_before_and_after_records_for_the_same_sku_or_a_documented_version_mapping_before_calling_recipe_change_quality_downgrade_or_shrinkflation","compare_net_quantity_pack_count_and_total_paid_on_a_common_unit_basis_while_preserving_product_form_and_market","keep_community_statements_at_their_author_category_product_time_storage_and_preference_scope_not_as_exact_chocolate_proof","verify_current_physical_identity_ingredients_allergens_net_quantity_manufacturer_or_repacker_market_lot_and_delivered_cost_before_purchase","screen_office_allergies_dietary_rules_and_shared_food_handling_before_any_tasting_or_stocking","use_only_a_small_reversible_brand_masked_trial_with_equal_portions_matched_temperature_and_randomized_or_counterbalanced_order","predeclare_acceptance_consumption_repeat_choice_and_waste_thresholds","choose_only_the_lowest_total_cost_exact_offer_that_passes_current_label_allergy_budget_and_office_trial_gates_otherwise_use_an_accepted_control_or_defer"],"scenario":"An office manager wants to refill a shared candy drawer and is tempted to buy whichever familiar chocolate listing has the highest displayed rating. The frozen candidates are a 9.99-dollar Kinder Bueno five-pack rated 98 percent over eight reviews, a 22.00-dollar personalized twelve-bar Hershey milk-chocolate pack rated 100 percent over two reviews, a 36.95-dollar Godiva-branded variety set packed by Candy Cabin rated 100 percent over one review, and a 14.99-dollar two-pound Goldenberg dark-chocolate peanut-chew assortment rated 95 percent over twelve reviews. The Goldenberg page says it has the same quality and taste always known, but none of the pages provides a dated old-versus-new formula or package pair. Background pages distinguish chocolate types, compound chocolate, couverture, market-specific naming and fat rules, food-label fields and comparable-unit pricing. Community discussions mention manufacturing-related quality decline in unrelated goods, disagreement with high aggregate ratings in books, and a snack-temperature taste effect, but do not test these exact chocolate offers. Current physical ingredient panels, historical matched packages and receipts, office allergy and dietary requirements, delivered totals and a controlled office trial remain unresolved.","target":"Decide what the four displayed ratings actually justify and whether the frozen corpus proves any quiet recipe downgrade, cocoa-butter substitution or shrinkflation. Compare the exact offers with their review counts, pack and product-form ambiguities, current physical-label needs and comparable-unit costs; explain how chocolate naming and fat rules vary by jurisdiction without classifying an exact SKU from a brand title; state the matched historical evidence required for a recipe or size-change claim; keep community anecdotes scoped; and end with a small reversible office trial and a selection procedure that chooses only the lowest-total-cost exact offer passing identity, ingredient, allergen, dietary, budget and local acceptance gates, uses an accepted control, or defers."},"graph_motif":"multi_branch_synthesis","graph_node_to_step_id":{"bridge_chocolate_label_fat_jurisdiction":"B1","bridge_current_historical_verification_gate":"B5","bridge_exact_offer_rating_sample_matrix":"B2","bridge_recipe_weight_change_pairing":"B3","bridge_reversible_office_candy_trial":"B6","bridge_scoped_rating_reputation_temperature":"B4","decision_evidence_bounded_office_candy_stocking":"D1","prop_bifl_quality_decline_anecdote_scope":"E1","prop_chocolate_type_jurisdiction_scope":"E2","prop_couverture_jurisdiction_scope":"E3","prop_food_labeling_field_scope":"E4","prop_godiva_candy_cabin_offer_scope":"E5","prop_goldenberg_offer_reputation_scope":"E6","prop_hershey_offer_rating_scope":"E7","prop_kinder_offer_rating_scope":"E8","prop_rating_disagreement_anecdote_scope":"E9","prop_snack_temperature_anecdote_scope":"E10","prop_unit_price_comparable_scope":"E11"},"motif_compilation_schema":"graph_motif_compilation_v1","topology_checks":{"has_multiple_independent_branches":true,"has_synthesized_decision":true}},"directly_scorable_gold":false,"discovery_parameters":{"max_expansion_depth":6,"per_stratum":50,"selection_seed":"46"},"graph_stamp":"evidence-graph-v1:sha256:c1ae51a1f3e2370a88c84456ec0e3ced8fc9bfc174e509f556eb9f9f9d4e27a1","schema":"motif_candidate_compilation_bundle_v1"}
